      "text": "Looking at overnight trips departing Friday 11/27 or this weekend (Sat 11/28 – Sun 11/29), there are two:\n\n- Producer, Fri 11/27 8:00 PM — listing has no passport/permit note\n- Producer, Sun 11/29 8:00 PM — listing has no passport/permit note\n\nNeither listing specifies passport or Mexican permit requirements, so I can't confirm docs from the data. If the trip fishes Mexican waters you'd need a CONAPESCA permit and FMM — confirm with H&M Landing before you book.\n\n<trip-card>{\"tripId\": \"hm-8b4572-11272000\", \"why\": [\"Overnight, Fri 11/27 8:00 PM\", \"Listing has no passport/permit note — confirm with H&M\"]}</trip-card>\n<trip-card>{\"tripId\": \"hm-8b4572-11292000\", \"why\": [\"Overnight, Sun 11/29 8:00 PM\", \"Listing has no passport/permit note — confirm with H&M\"]}</trip-card>\n\nFor reference on the rules, see [CONAPESCA permit](https://www.gob.mx/conapesca/documentos/conapesca-01-016-pesca-deportivo-recreativa) and [FMM / INM](https://www.gob.mx/inm/acciones-y-programas/sport-fishing-and-nautical-tourism).\n\n<followups>[\"Show 1.5-day trips this weekend that require a passport\", \"What about overnights that explicitly don't need a passport?\", \"Compare the two Producer overnights\"]</followups>",
